WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.876
You want a little update on space wars?

00:00:01.876 --> 00:00:04.629
Well, North Korea says that they just took a picture

00:00:04.629 --> 00:00:05.505
of the White House

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:07.507
with their new spy satellite.

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:08.675
It took them three tries,

00:00:08.675 --> 00:00:10.010
but North Korea eventually

00:00:10.010 --> 00:00:11.636
got a successful launch

00:00:11.636 --> 00:00:13.888
of a spy satellite into orbit.

00:00:13.888 --> 00:00:14.806
And the first thing they said

00:00:14.806 --> 00:00:16.016
is, “hey, we're taking pictures

00:00:16.016 --> 00:00:16.933
of the Pentagon

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:18.101
and the White House

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:20.061
and U.S. nuclear installations.”

00:00:20.061 --> 00:00:20.979
We don't know if they're bluffing,

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:22.147
but either way, the U.S.

00:00:22.147 --> 00:00:24.024
and their allies are pretty pissed.

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:25.150
But North Korea is just like, 

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.651
“Hey, we have a right to

00:00:26.651 --> 00:00:27.902
develop our weapons systems

00:00:27.902 --> 00:00:29.654
just like you do, United States.”

00:00:29.654 --> 00:00:30.572
This all comes at a time

00:00:30.572 --> 00:00:31.781
when North and South Korea

00:00:31.781 --> 00:00:33.283
had just made this agreement

00:00:33.283 --> 00:00:34.826
to like lessen tensions

00:00:34.826 --> 00:00:35.827
and not do things like this.

00:00:35.827 --> 00:00:37.412
But now both sides are breaking

00:00:37.412 --> 00:00:38.955
their agreements, there's an escalation.

00:00:38.955 --> 00:00:40.665
This happens all the time with these two

00:00:40.665 --> 00:00:42.834
and this is just another episode of it,

00:00:42.834 --> 00:00:45.545
but this episode is happening in space.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:46.337
If you want to better understand

00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:48.256
global politics, follow along for more.

